摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 的 Agent Teams 多智能体协作插件，支持多个 AI Agent 组成团队，协同完成复杂任务，实现任务分配、并行执行、成员通信与团队协作。 AgentTeams plugin for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1332073142","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-agent-teams","slug":"NanmiCoder/dsh-agent-teams","topics":["agentteams","deepseekharness","dsh","dsh-agent-teams","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 的 Agent Teams 多智能体协作插件，支持多个 AI Agent 组成团队，协同完成复杂任务，实现任务分配、并行执行、成员通信与团队协作。 AgentTeam"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"s plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"## One prompt. A working team."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-agent-teams` turns the current DeepSeek Harness session into a captain that can assemble durabl"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"e sub-agents, split a goal into dependency-aware tasks, and coordinate work through direct messages."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Ask in natural language. The plugin provides the team protocol, 14 coordination tools, persistent st"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ate, an automatic shared-task scheduler, and a live Web UI—without requiring a separate workflow eng"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" an automatic shared-task scheduler, and a live Web UI—without requiring a separate workflow engine."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Releases"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Latest release restores member model fallback on Harness `0.2.2-rc.1` and improves task settlement, "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"activity updates, and artifact auditing. The recommended host is Harness `0.2.1-rc.2`. See the teste"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"d matrix and release notes."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Why AgentTeams?"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Capability | What it changes |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| **Captain-led delegation** | The current session creates the team, assigns roles, and consolidates"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" the final result. |\n| **Durable members** | Members are continuable DSH sub-agents that can be woke"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"n for focused follow-up turns. |\n| **Dependency-aware tasks** | Tasks move through explicit states a"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"nd cannot be claimed before their dependencies finish. |\n| **Automatic reuse and safe takeover** | I"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"dle members claim the next ready task; reassignment revokes stale attempts before new work starts, a"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"nd cold recovery retries stranded open attempts. |\n| **Direct messaging** | Members send durable mai"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"lbox messages directly to teammates or the captain—no relay required. |\n| **Live activity panel** | "},{"id":"p10s8","text":"The Web UI combines segmented progress, a collapsible roster, and an interactive task DAG; running t"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"asks show the member's model, and completed archives retain their full member and task history. |\n| "},{"id":"p10s10","text":"**Plan before execution** | Normal `/agent-teams` runs stage an unspawned roster and DAG first. The "},{"id":"p10s11","text":"Web panel uses the host model catalog for member routes. Returning to chat stops the planning turn, "},{"id":"p10s12","text":"asks what should change, and revises the same draft; discarding archives the draft, aborts the turn,"},{"id":"p10s13","text":" and explicitly prevents automatic recreation. Only **Approve & Run** enables scheduling; each membe"},{"id":"p10s14","text":"r starts with its first ready task. |\n| **Quality gates** | Opt-in quality tasks support requirement"},{"id":"p10s15","text":"s → implementation → verification → review → integration contracts, automatic repair/re-review, and "},{"id":"p10s16","text":"explicit resume. Scope control is a completion-time audit, not host write interception. See docs/qua"},{"id":"p10s17","text":" Scope control is a completion-time audit, not host write interception. See docs/quality-gates.md. |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The conversation card and activity panel use Harness's official locale service. They follow live lan"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"guage changes between English and Simplified Chinese—including status labels, dynamic summaries, con"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"trols, archive markers, and accessibility text—without a page reload or a separate plugin setting."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install and choose versions"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Recommended pair: DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1-rc.2` + AgentTeams `0.1.29`. The host remains an RC.**"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Use case | DeepSeek Harness | AgentTeams plugin |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| **Recommended** | **`0.2.1-rc.2`** | **`0.1.29`** |\n| Preview host | `0.2.2-rc.1`, `0.2.1-rc.3` | "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"`0.1.29` |\n| Previous recommended RC | `0.2.1-rc.1`, `0.2.0-rc.2`, `0.1.7-rc.2` | `0.1.29` |\n| Legac"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"y RC | `0.1.5-rc.1`, `0.1.5-rc.2`, `0.1.5-rc.3` | `0.1.29` |\n| Retaining an older RC | `0.1.2-rc.1` "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"| `0.1.29` |\n| Developer Alpha testing | `0.1.2-alpha.5` | `0.1.29` |\n| Retaining an older Alpha | `"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"0.1.2-alpha.2` | `0.1.29` |\n| Other installable hosts | At or above `0.1.2-alpha.2` | `0.1.29` |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"CI verifies the exact hosts listed above the last row. The installer accepts other hosts at or above"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" the minimum version."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Desktop app"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"In the app sidebar, open **Plugins → Add plugin**. You can install directly from GitHub by pasting t"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"his repository URL into the plugin input, without a version, tag, or commit suffix:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"This installs from the default branch and is available immediately after release. The equivalent sho"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"rthand is also supported:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### CLI / Web: 1. Install DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The command selects the host's npm `latest`; check `dsh --version` against the support matrix after "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"upgrading. Alpha is opt-in: select an exact Alpha version from the table and lock all host dependenc"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ies as described in the maintenance guide."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"1. For a request to use AgentTeams, the captain follows the core protocol already in its system inst"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ructions. It continues an existing team and uses `agent_teams_status` when current state needs check"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ing. When no team exists, the goal becomes a staged plan for review.\n2. The captain adds role-specif"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ic members backed by continuable sub-agents.\n3. The goal becomes tasks with owners and explicit depe"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"ndencies.\n4. The shared scheduler uses real `running / idle / ready` state to atomically claim one r"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"eady task per idle member and wake it. An interrupted resident attempt stays parked and can resume t"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"hrough a direct message without losing its capability; after a cold process restart, the scheduler r"},{"id":"p27s8","text":"etries stranded open work with a fresh attempt.\n5. Members update with the current `attempt_id`; rea"},{"id":"p27s9","text":"ssignment or captain takeover revokes the old attempt and waits for the old worker to quiesce before"},{"id":"p27s10","text":" a new attempt starts.\n6. The captain presents the combined result, then archives the complete team "},{"id":"p27s11","text":"attempt starts.\n6. The captain presents the combined result, then archives the complete team record."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Team state is stored under `<workspace>/.agent-teams/`; the Web panel reads that disk truth and comb"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ines it with live sub-agent activity."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Member creation is zero-interaction by default: a member on the captain's current LLM route snapshot"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"s that provider, model, and reasoning effort, while a member on a requested alternative route snapsh"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ots the target model's default effort; later continuations restore the resolved snapshot. Only an ex"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"plicit heterogeneous-team request (for example, “backend on provider A/model X, frontend on provider"},{"id":"p29s5","text":" B/model Y”) supplies a member-specific `provider` + `model`; there is no per-member model or reason"},{"id":"p29s6","text":") supplies a member-specific `provider` + `model`; there is no per-member model or reasoning prompt."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
